      {
        "type": "LocationModule",
        "id": "20260816-1018-8b50-b057-3437e769d071",
        "title": "Location",
        "background_color": null,
        "use_background_color": false,
        "hide": false,
        "value": {
          "formatted_address": "Mall of The Emirates - E11 Sheikh Zayed Rd - Umm Suqeim Third - Umm Suqeim 3 - Dubai - United Arab Emirates",
          "geometry": {
            "location": {
              "lat": 25.1401778,
              "lng": 55.1914266
            }
          },
          "place_id": "ChIJyRskyFFqXz4RTdZ8S65vtAQ",
          "icon": "https://maps.gstatic.com/mapfiles/place_api/icons/v1/png_71/geocode-71.png",
          "name": "Mall of The Emirates",
          "vicinity": "E11 Sheikh Zayed Rd",
          "rating": null,
          "url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=339018666341094989",
          "user_ratings_total": null,
          "reviews": []
        },
        "hide_reviews": false
      },
      {
        "type": "ReviewsModule",
        "id": "20260816-1019-8d19-9693-084ca42561cb",
        "title": "Reviews",
        "background_color": null,
        "use_background_color": false,
        "hide": false,
        "foldable": false,
        "layout_type": "cards",
        "reviews": [
          {
            "id": "20260816-1019-8956-a051-ae936c36ac3c",
            "reviewer_name": "Muhammad Usman Iqbal",
            "reviewer_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVLKYshl_Z9-LFqdk7ZIXvA_bD1lkotD5OvnMLSG5TviIIivH4O=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": "Mall of the Emirates Metro Station, like other metro stations in Dubai, is beautifully designed, neat, and well-maintained. It is one of the busiest stations, as it is directly connected to the Mall of the Emirates and an RTA bus station, making it a convenient hub for commuters.",
            "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
            "hidden": false,
            "locked": true,
            "google_review_key": "Muhammad Usman Iqbal_1738602150"
          },
          {
            "id": "20260816-1019-8156-b051-dea26c3f986d",
            "reviewer_name": "Alex Eyagu",
            "reviewer_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVkNmDB0YIFcKHnQCVArtqeIkOUU98TyCr25icO5pEARsg1aQlU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": "Exceptional,great and good looking.\nClean and organized,\nThere's no congestion except only evenning hours, but not every evening, the staffs too are so helpful.\nFlowers 🌸🌹🌹🌹🌸",
            "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
            "hidden": false,
            "locked": true,
            "google_review_key": "Alex Eyagu_1763890659"
          },
          {
            "id": "20260816-1019-8456-a051-662f5ae0b933",
            "reviewer_name": "Sahi",
            "reviewer_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI1LMK67cH_9druENEe82GUBIDhB5OfGJ8B4exBH51gyi1VQA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": "One of the most convenient metro stations in Dubai. It’s directly connected to Mall of the Emirates via a covered, air-conditioned walkway, which is a lifesaver in the heat. The station is exceptionally clean, well-maintained, and the staff are always efficient at the service counters. Perfect for tourists and residents alike!",
            "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
            "hidden": false,
            "locked": true,
            "google_review_key": "Sahi_1776882901"
          },
          {
            "id": "20260816-1019-8956-a051-e79007cc0200",
            "reviewer_name": "Andrea",
            "reviewer_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJCyq9sw_ZpXmIUDSw9yNIVQuNSF-Mzm4nldYnluoBGesgg6A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": "Mall of the Emirates offers a different yet equally impressive experience compared to other major malls in Dubai. While it may not be as vast as Dubai Mall, it excels in comfort, accessibility and overall balance. The mall is beautifully maintained, easy to navigate and designed to provide a relaxed and enjoyable shopping environment, making it particularly appealing for both tourists and residents.\nOne of its most distinctive features is Ski Dubai, which alone makes the mall unique on a global level. The contrast of stepping from a modern shopping environment into an indoor ski resort is something truly remarkable and perfectly reflects Dubai’s ability to surprise and innovate. Beyond this iconic attraction, the mall offers a wide selection of shops, from luxury brands to popular international retailers, ensuring a diverse and satisfying shopping experience.\nThe dining options are extensive and well distributed throughout the mall, with a strong mix of restaurants, cafés and casual dining spots. Whether you are looking for a quick coffee, a relaxed lunch or a full dinner, Mall of the Emirates provides plenty of high quality options. The atmosphere is generally calmer than other major malls, which makes it particularly pleasant for spending longer periods of time without feeling overwhelmed.\nAccessibility is another major advantage of this mall. Its direct connection to the metro, combined with ample parking facilities, makes it extremely convenient to reach. Inside, the layout is intuitive, signage is clear and the overall flow of movement is well planned. Cleanliness and maintenance standards are consistently high, contributing to a comfortable and enjoyable experience every time.\nMall of the Emirates manages to combine entertainment, shopping and dining in a way that feels cohesive and well balanced. It is a mall that invites you to slow down, explore and truly enjoy your time rather than rushing from one place to another. Overall, it remains one of Dubai’s most reliable and enjoyable shopping destinations, offering quality, comfort and a touch of uniqueness that keeps people coming back.",
            "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
            "hidden": false,
            "locked": true,
            "google_review_key": "Andrea_1770896445"
          },
          {
            "id": "20260816-1021-8f02-a063-a1651241c422",
            "reviewer_name": "Hassan Bilal",
            "reviewer_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVoiCd402iZh_HcF_W8tNHHpuhpO7QjNz_rwoGd1Z7qinPunNU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": "it’s a good place ❤️",
            "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
            "hidden": false,
            "locked": false,
            "google_review_key": null
          }
        ],
